    },
    {
      "t": "这个始祖是木槿的一个亚种，它是现代扶桑的祖先，现在所有的蓝色扶桑，都有它的血统"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/b6220e1d469129b5dd35765016b0f694.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/03f171a62d72c645e1938b518d7449d6.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_4449875843_000.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "木槿，这个我想大家都不会晓得此货其实也是扶桑的直系始祖呢"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/97d4f86017f5517e2b0d0278743b3947.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/0943790b72d829e3edfa699ca6a2eeea.webp"
    },
    {
      "i": "https://img.feijibei.top/images/tieba_4449875843_007.webp"
    },
    {
      "t": "这个就和扶桑没多大关系呢"
